  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>재과만에서 김밥으로 식물의 줄기를 표현하는 아이디어를 얻어 저도 이번에 학생들과 함께 해 보았습니다.</p><p>생각보다 괜찮은 작품이 나오지는 않았지만 학생들이 1시간 즐겁게 김밥을 말고 먹는 걸로 행복해한 수업이었습니다~~^^</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26617D3A58F0A31925\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"540\" height=\"329\" style=\"width: 540px; height: 329px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170414_191419716.jpg\"  id=\"A_26617D3A58F0A319256F3E\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22708B3458F0A3A22D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"528\" height=\"328\" style=\"width: 528px; height: 328px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"802\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170414_191416350.jpg\"  id=\"A_22708B3458F0A3A22D4849\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25705B3A58F0A3E20B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"393\" height=\"360\" style=\"width: 393px; height: 360px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"797\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170414_191415363.jpg\"  id=\"A_25705B3A58F0A3E20B5E03\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/266CB93558F0A41907\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"389\" height=\"332\" style=\"width: 389px; height: 332px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"793\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170414_191415833.jpg\"  id=\"A_266CB93558F0A41907E11A\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263DBB3858F0A4CE18\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"648\" height=\"435\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 435px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"806\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170414_191417067.jpg\"  id=\"A_263DBB3858F0A4CE1841FA\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
